  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The direction ratio of line parallel to the line of the shortest distance between the lines<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>Now given line passing through&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>(</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>And having direction ratio <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math>,</p><p>So, the equation is given by,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></math></p><p>Let the line intersect the plane at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>&nbsp;lies on the plane&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Hence, point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So, the distance of point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;from point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> will be,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></math></p></blockquote>",
